<title>USA: Lands' End to build new office building.</title>
<headline>Lands' End to build new office building.</headline>
<dateline>DODGEVILLE, Wis. 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lands' End Inc said Wednesday it will soon start building a 110,000-square-foot office building at its headquarters.</p>
<p>The company plans to break ground on its latest expansion project June 1. The staff will move into the facility in fall 1998, Lands' End said.</p>
<p>Lands' End is a direct merchant of casual clothing and accessories.</p>
<p>Its shares were off 1/4 at 27-3/8 in Wednesday trading.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
